Sɛ yɛdu homebea hɔ a yɛbɛte 'Nigyesɛm sɛ, \"mommra ha, mō a wɔahy'ra mo, Hann nsase ni, na 'nigye afie nso ni,\" O, hena remf'ro atwer' a ɛte sɛɛ?

